cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AMR Navigation Stack: ROS 2 Jazzy and Gazebo Harmonic with custom A* and DWA Nav2 plugins"
abstract: >-
  A complete autonomous mobile robot navigation system for a differential-drive robot:
  wheel-encoder/IMU odometry, SLAM Toolbox mapping, AMCL localization, Nav2 navigation with
  dynamic obstacle avoidance, custom A* global and Dynamic Window Approach local planners
  implemented as Nav2 plugins, and a reproducible benchmark against Nav2's planners.
authors:
  - given-names: "Munavir Zaman"
    family-names: "P K"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-4537-6234"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/munavirzaman-git/amr-nav-ros2"
keywords:
  - ROS 2
  - Nav2
  - SLAM
  - AMCL
  - path planning
  - A*
  - Dynamic Window Approach
  - mobile robots
  - Gazebo
